{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1VsxxTAgy9T2PvJfNX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**No. Don't start it before the filing feature ships.**\n\n**Why**\n\n- **The numbers don't fit.** Filing needs all four engineers until March, and the deadline is April, so you have about a month of slack. Moving two engineers to the app for three months would likely push filing well past the deadline. That's the one date you can't move.\n- **Missing the deadline costs far more than missing receipts.** If filing isn't ready, sole traders who are required to file quarterly will leave for a product that can. Being behind on receipts loses you some marketing and some leads. Being behind on filing loses you existing customers.\n- **The demand signal is weak.** \"Receipts\" being a top blog search term shows people are interested in the topic. It doesn't show they'd switch or pay for an app. A competitor launching one tells you what they're doing, not what your customers need.\n- **Splitting the team costs extra.** With four engineers, taking two away is a big loss, and switching between projects slows both down.\n\n**What to do instead**\n\n1. **Give marketing a way to act on receipts now without engineering time.** For example: receipt-focused content that captures the search traffic, a waitlist to measure real demand, or a partnership or integration with an existing receipt-scanning tool if one is cheap to set up.\n2. **Pitch receipts as part of filing.** Quarterly filing relies on digital records, so receipt capture can be the next step after filing ships, not a competing project.\n3. **Revisit in March or April**, using waitlist signups and any churn to the competitor as evidence.\n4. **Ask the engineers what would change this.** If they say filing can lose people without slipping, that would change the answer, but your timeline suggests it can't."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3604,"cache_read_input_tokens":4609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3604},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9469441c-48da-4608-a526-ab015c7f55ee","uuid":"a0d21e26-64ec-4d0b-b02c-dc973e0e9d88","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:13:01.052Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1Vsg6Ws4rCw4LFXc2P"}
